# head/adult/youth/expr: the youth's expressions (blink, hurt, closed, talk, fierce)
# P2b FACES (wave 2): GENERATED from the adult maps by the FACES spec (the boy = the man's views, the girl = the
# woman's as `when girl replace`); edit the adult maps, then regenerate. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body youth
role expr blink
role expr hurt
role expr closed
role expr talk
role expr fierce
layer face
anchor head
keys expr
z 2
tags overlay mirror-ok

